<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Log-Tek black empowerment talks continue.</title>
<headline>Log-Tek black empowerment talks continue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics group Log-Tek Holdings Ltd said on Monday that talks were still continuing with a black empowerment group and it urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
